Z||000003||BroCar 87||07-14-2000||11:14 PM||||WAIT-A-SECOND, If Heat vents or supposed to VENT heat... wouldn't the scoops be forcing against the heat coming up??? I thought about this too... I am getting the little scoops from A&A...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/RearMINIs.jpg"> <BR>This is what I want it to look like  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/REAR.jpg"> <BR>||||reg||1
